2. cmpunlocker (https://github.com/amoghmunikote/cmpunlocker), GPL-2.0
   The release packages contain kernel modules built from cmpunlocker's patches applied to NVIDIA's
   open-gpu-kernel-modules. Corresponding source: the cmpunlocker tag named in each release's
   manifest.json (field "cmpunlocker") plus the NVIDIA open-gpu-kernel-modules tag equal to the
   package's "driver" version. The Nvidia userspace libraries and firmware in each package come from the
   stock unraid-nvidia-driver package for the same driver version.

3. ich777/unraid_kernel (https://github.com/ich777/unraid_kernel) supplies the pre-compiled Unraid
   kernel trees and build images used by CI only. Nothing from it is shipped to users.
